{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make tilesets for your games in minutes.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Automatic tileset generation:<br>          <ul class=\"bb_ul\">          <li>Rectangular tilesets<br>          </li><li>Isometric tilesets<br>          </li><li>Hexagonal type A tilesets<br>          </li><li>Hexagonal type B tilesets<br>          </li><li>Platformer tilesets<br>          </li><li>Street/path tilesets<br>          </li></ul></li><li>Resize tile<br></li><li>Select the number of columns in tileset<br></li><li>Change the distance between tiles<br></li><li>Specify the type of blending transitions between tiles (with or without blurring)<br></li><li>Create custom masks<br></li><li>Replace tile and all its mixes in the finished tileset<br></li><li>Changing tile position in tileset<br></li><li>Selects the background color (transparent for .png)<br></li><li>Saving and loading project .tsg<br></li><li>Saving the finished tileset to .png or .bmp<br></li><li>Exporting the created tiles in single files</li></ul><br>The program generates a tile transition map from textures (using built-in masks). You can select how many textures will be mixed (1-4). And of course you can select any textures you want.<br>The program then combines these tiles into a tile set, and you can change the position of the tiles and change the number of columns.<br><br>All tiles can be used for commercial purposes.<br><br>Yes, you can save to PNG and use the output from this program in GameMaker, RPG Maker, Construct, AppGameKit, Tiled Map Editor,...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625100/extras/569d79a5634add4763a5f78f73702b0a.avif?t=1761769370\" width=948 height=212 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/625100?t=1761769370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati